1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:03,557
Voyager 1 sebentar lagi
mencetak sejarah...

2
00:00:03,557 --> 00:00:07,323
benda buatan manusia pertama
yang sejauh 1 hari cahaya.

3
00:00:07,323 --> 00:00:08,344
Artinya,

4
00:00:08,344 --> 00:00:10,009
kirim "halo" hari ini...

5
00:00:10,009 --> 00:00:11,845
balasannya baru datang lusa.

6
00:00:11,845 --> 00:00:14,664
Hampir 50 tahun ia terbang menjauh...

7
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:16,414
kini dayanya sekarat.

8
00:00:16,414 --> 00:00:18,657
Tapi ia membawa piringan emas,

9
00:00:18,657 --> 00:00:20,889
berisi sapaan bahasa Indonesia:

10
00:00:20,889 --> 00:00:23,072
"Selamat malam hadirin sekalian...

11
00:00:23,072 --> 00:00:24,333
selamat berpisah,

12
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:25,894
dan sampai bertemu lagi."

13
00:00:25,894 --> 00:00:27,209
Kalau boleh titip pesan,

14
00:00:27,209 --> 00:00:28,496
kamu mau bilang apa?

15
00:00:28,496 --> 00:00:29,980
Tulis di komentar!
